ge section (X = Q^r = q^{3/2}/(1+q-q^2-q^3+q^{3/2})) are the same convention-C residue and need the same check. (2) TOKEN-SUBSTITUTION SWEEP DAMAGE, two sites: line 71 begins a sentence with a lowercase 'canonical evaluation at q_0 ~ 1.110 matches the symbolic forms above to ~10^{-16}' - the lowercase start shows a capitalised 'Numerical' was replaced by 'canonical'; and line 45 'verified to canonical precision 10^{-16}' is the same substitution for 'numerical precision'. (3) NO-FLOAT64: 'The vanishing is exact (verified to ... 10^{-16})' reports agreement at the float64 floor as evidence of exactness; 10^{-16} is the resolution of the arithmetic, not a measurement of the vanishing. (4) VERIFIED CORRECT: tr_M(sigma_1 sigma_2 sigma_1) = h z^2 + z follows exactly from cyclicity plus sigma_1^2 = h sigma_1 + 1 (SS7a form), and the E_inf table uses sigma_i throughout (SS7a compliant). (5) q_0 ~ 1.110 is a 4-figure rounding, consistent with both live pins.","history":2},{"id":"trap-thesis-restatement","group":"trap","result":"fail","severity":"major","stale":true,"freshness":"stale","changed":["md","ts"],"at":"2026-08-21","reviewer":"agent","by":"agent:r07","notes":"STRUCTURAL - not fixed inline (11 lines, contains display-level math). Proposed: delete lines 87-98 (the second copy). While fixing, note that the surviving copy says 'the per-class derivations BELOW can be replaced by a uniform application of the bridge formula' but the per-class derivations are ABOVE it (lines 20-70) - either move the section above the alpha_0..alpha_3 subsections or change 'below' to 'above'.","history":2},{"id":"trap-triples","group":"trap","result":"pass","stale":true,"freshness":"stale","changed":["md","ts"],"at":"2026-08-21","reviewer":"agent","by":"agent:r07","history":2},{"id":"uses-editorial-hygiene","group":"uses","result":"pass","stale":false,"freshness":"fresh","at":"2026-11-24","reviewer":"script","by":"pipeline/qa-checkers-uses.ts","history":1},{"id":"uses-formal-coverage","grou